weavefront — Weave Surface Language Frontend
Copyright 2026 Jukka Aho

This product includes software developed as the surface-language
frontend for the Weave programming language: it converts
`.weave` source files (surface syntax) to `.wir` files (the
stable Weave Intermediate Representation contract). The compiler
itself is written in WIR.

Upstream:    https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavefront
Dependency:  https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavec0  (pinned via WEAVEC0_TAG)
Dependency:  https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavec1  (pinned via WEAVEC1_TAG)
